Package: synos-apt-config
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: admin
Priority: important
Architecture: all
Depends: synos-archive-keyring
Maintainer: ${BRAND_VENDOR} <${BRAND_URL_SUPPORT}>
Description: ${BRAND_NAME} package repository configuration
 Adds the ${BRAND_NAME} package repository to apt. The repository URL is
 the manifest's packages.repository; the source is shipped disabled when
 none is configured.
